13:["$","div",null,{"className":"prose-custom max-w-none","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["# 10 Proven Email Deliverability Optimization Techniques That Actually Work in 2026"]}],["$","p","2",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Excerpt:"}]," Struggling with emails landing in spam? This guide covers 10 actionable deliverability optimization techniques--including list hygiene, sender reputation management, and AI-powered authentication--backed by 2026 industry data and real-world benchmarks."]}],["$","hr","4",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}],["$","p","6",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Email deliverability isn't just about *sending* emails--it's about ensuring your message lands *in the inbox*, gets *seen*, and *triggers action*. In 2026, the stakes are higher than ever: According to Validity's *2026 Email Data Report*, ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"38% of commercial emails never reach the primary inbox"}],", with 22% filtered to spam and 16% blocked outright. Worse, Gmail and Apple Mail now use *behavioral AI models* that analyze engagement patterns at the individual subscriber level--not just domain-level reputation."]}],["$","p","8",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["The good news? Deliverability is highly controllable. Below are ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"10 proven, field-tested techniques"}],"--each validated by major ESPs (like SendGrid, Mailgun, and Klaviyo), supported by 2026 data, and designed for immediate implementation."]}],["$","hr","10",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}],["$","h2","12",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"1. Enforce Double Opt-In 