2a:["$","h2","50",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"5. Segment by Engagement Tier (Not Just Demographics)"}]
2b:["$","p","51",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Key insight:"}]," 2026 data shows segmented campaigns based on *last-click behavior* (e.g., \"clicked product page in last 7 days\") achieve ",["$","strong","3",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"3.2x higher inbox placement"}]," than demographic-only segmentation (HubSpot Email Benchmark Report)."]}]
2c:["$","p","53",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["✅ ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Actionable step:"}]," Build dynamic segments like:"]}]
2d:["$","p","54",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- `Engaged_7d`: Opened *or* clicked in past week"]}]
2e:["$","p","55",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- `At_Risk_30d`: Last engagement >30 days ago"]}]
2f:["$","p","56",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- `Dormant_90d`: No engagement >90 days"]}]
30:["$","p","58",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Send different content, frequency, and even *different sending domains* (e.g., `news@` for engaged, `offers@` for at-risk)."]}]
31:["$","hr","60",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}]
32:["$","h2","62",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"6. Maintain Sender Reputation with Consistent Volume & Timing"}]
33:["$","p","63",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["ISPs track *volume consistency* as a trust signal. A 200% spike in daily sends triggers suspicion--even if your list is clean."]}]
34:["$","p","65",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["✅ ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Actionable step:"}]," Use your ESP's \"send pacing\" feature (e.g., Mailgun's *Throttling Rules* or SendGrid's *Batch Scheduling*) to cap hourly volume at ±15% of your 30-day average. Also, avoid sending between 2-4 AM local time--Yahoo's latest algorithm downweights emails sent during low-engagement windows."]}]
35:["$","hr","67",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}]
36:["$","h2","69",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"7. Avoid Spam Trigger Words *and* AI-Generated Red Flags"}]
37:["$","p","70",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"New in 2026:"}]," Gmail's updated classifier scans for *LLM hallmarks*: overuse of exclamation points (!!!), excessive adjectives (\"amazing,\" \"incredible\"), and generic CTAs (\"Click here!\"). Emails flagged for \"AI saturation\" see 28% lower inbox placement (Google Postmaster Tools, April 2026)."]}]
38:["$","p","72",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["✅ ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Actionable step:"}]," Run subject lines and body copy through ",["$","strong","3",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Hemingway Editor"}]," (aim for Grade 6-8 readability) and ",["$","strong","5",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Mail-Tester.com"}],"'s AI Detection Mode. Replace \"HURRY! LIMITED TIME!!!\" with \"Your cart expires in 24 hours.\""]}]
39:["$","hr","74",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}]
3a:["$","h2","76",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"8. Monitor Real-Time Reputation Metrics"}]
3b:["$","p","77",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Forget \"open rates.\" Track what matters:"]}]
3c:["$","p","78",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Spam Complaint Rate"}]," (<0.1% = safe; >0.3% = critical)"]}]
3d:["$","p","79",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Unknown User Rate"}]," (<2% ideal)"]}]
